 width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">其他</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5%</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">其他特殊需求</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>数据来源</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：雪球, 2026; 中国化工报, 2025</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br></p><h3 style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">6.5 成本构成分析</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"https://space-static.coze.site/7621609504962150662/cost_composition-c736fc083e.png?sign=1777136998-15f70a3445-0-9294561b472540588bb9efac6f229398fabbd1759cb699e16754b83deeee9a6c\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 640px;height: auto;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(8, 13, 30, 0.9); font-size: 14px;\">表格</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br></p><table style=\"width: auto; text-align: left;\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">成本项目</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">占比</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">说明</span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">废弃油脂</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">71%</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">占SAF成本的71%</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">氢气</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">12%</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">占SAF成本的12%</span></td>